    {
      "type": "tool-result",
      "toolCallId": "call_7c7531c110924af2bdb2ed3d",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No browsing, file writes, or delegation used — verdicts below are based solely on the numbered captures.

**C1** → **supported**. [1] contains TOC entries "15.4.2. 301 Moved Permanently", "15.4.3. 302 Found", "15.4.4. 303 See Other", "15.4.8. 307 Temporary Redirect", "15.4.9. 308 Permanent Redirect" — matches title/number/scope exactly. Minor scope note only: they sit under §15.4 heading "Redirection 3xx"; calling 301/302/303/307/308 "五个小节" implies completeness of §15.4, which also contains other subsections (e.g., 300 Multiple Choices, 304, 305, 306). Verdict unchanged if rephrased as "§15.4 下含以下五个小节".

**C2** → **supported**. [2] verbatim: "For 3xx (Redirection) responses, the Location value refers to the preferred target resource for automatically redirecting the request." "首选目标资源" = preferred target resource; "自动重定向" = automatically redirecting. Exact 1:1.

